{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10130090","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10130090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1013009001:0":{"text":"골렘의 머리 쪽에 특수한 장치가 장착되어 있는 것 같아요. 그게 골렘을 움직이게 하는 에너지원인 것 같은데...","source_cn":"魔偶的头部镶嵌着某个特殊结构。看起来像是它行动的能源……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66C1F9F003322D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1013009002:0":{"text":"그러니까, 골렘이 멈춘 건 에너지원이 파괴되었기 때문이라는 건가요?","source_cn":"所以，魔偶停下来，是因为它的能源被破坏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34309D20D2B2C444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1013009002":{"text":"그러니까, 골렘이 멈춘 건 에너지원이 파괴되었기 때문이라는 건가요?","source_cn":"所以，魔偶停下来，是因为它胸口的能源被破坏了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34309D20D2B2C444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1013009003:1":{"text":"저도 두 분의 의견에 동의해요. 어쩌면 이게 골렘의 화를 막을 방법 중 하나가 될지도 모르겠네요.","source_cn":"我也赞同两位的意见，或许这将成为我们制止魔偶为祸的途径之一。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x825739E55D3698E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013009005:1":{"text":"아쉽지만 지금으로서 얻은 정보는 이것뿐이네요.","source_cn":"很可惜，就现在而言，我们只能获取到这些信息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x025DBEA3D05BF5A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"이론상으론 맞아","source_cn":"理论上是这样","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6C227C2A544376","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이론상으론 맞아","female":"이론상으론 맞아","variant_male_record_index":"61692","variant_female_record_index":"61693","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013009004:0":{"text":"상상을 초월하는 힘과 흔적을 남기지 않는 무기까지. 이미 보통 사람의 힘을 능가하고 있어요...","source_cn":"这种程度的力量和毫无痕迹的武器，已经超越了凡人之力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA46F446DF519126","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"사라진 무기도 신경 쓰여","source_cn":"消散的武器也很令人在意","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x357D634201F65EA2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사라진 무기도 신경 쓰여","female":"사라진 무기도 신경 쓰여","variant_male_record_index":"61694","variant_female_record_index":"61695","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"테미히아","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"발렌","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}